Feature: Todo Management # features/todo.feature:1
  As a user
  I want to manage my todo list
  So that I can track my tasks
  Feature: Todo Management  # features/todo.feature:1

  Scenario: Add a new todo                 # features/todo.feature:9
    Given I am on the todo page            # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    When I add a todo "Buy groceries"      # features/steps/todo_steps.py:11
    Then I should see 1 todo               # features/steps/todo_steps.py:67
    And the todo should be "Buy groceries" # features/steps/todo_steps.py:75

  Scenario: Add several todos keeps their order  # features/todo.feature:14
    Given I am on the todo page                  # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    When I add a todo "First"                    # features/steps/todo_steps.py:11
    And I add a todo "Second"                    # features/steps/todo_steps.py:11
    Then I should see 2 todos                    # features/steps/todo_steps.py:67
    And the todos should be "First, Second"      # features/steps/todo_steps.py:75

  Scenario: Complete a todo                # features/todo.feature:20
    Given I am on the todo page            # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    Given I have a todo "Read book"        # features/steps/todo_steps.py:11
    When I mark the todo as complete       # features/steps/todo_steps.py:25
    Then the todo should be marked as done # features/steps/todo_steps.py:83
    And the active count should be 0       # features/steps/todo_steps.py:88

  Scenario: Delete a todo          # features/todo.feature:26
    Given I am on the todo page    # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    Given I have a todo "Old task" # features/steps/todo_steps.py:11
    When I delete the todo         # features/steps/todo_steps.py:30
    Then I should see 0 todos      # features/steps/todo_steps.py:67

  Scenario: Edit a todo                      # features/todo.feature:31
    Given I am on the todo page              # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"           # features/steps/todo_steps.py:11
    When I change the todo to "Buy oat milk" # features/steps/todo_steps.py:35
    Then the todo should be "Buy oat milk"   # features/steps/todo_steps.py:75

  Scenario: Clear completed todos     # features/todo.feature:36
    Given I am on the todo page       # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    Given I have the following todos: # features/steps/todo_steps.py:17
      | text   | completed |
      | Done 1 | true      |
      | Open   | false     |
      | Done 2 | true      |
    When I clear the completed todos  # features/steps/todo_steps.py:57
    Then the todos should be "Open"   # features/steps/todo_steps.py:75

  Scenario Outline: Filter todos -- @1.1   # features/todo.feature:56
    Given I am on the todo page            # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    Given I have the following todos:      # features/steps/todo_steps.py:17
      | text   | completed |
      | Task 1 | false     |
      | Task 2 | true      |
      | Task 3 | false     |
    When I filter by "All"                 # features/steps/todo_steps.py:62
    Then I should see 3 todo(s)            # features/steps/todo_steps.py:67

  Scenario Outline: Filter todos -- @1.2   # features/todo.feature:57
    Given I am on the todo page            # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    Given I have the following todos:      # features/steps/todo_steps.py:17
      | text   | completed |
      | Task 1 | false     |
      | Task 2 | true      |
      | Task 3 | false     |
    When I filter by "Active"              # features/steps/todo_steps.py:62
    Then I should see 2 todo(s)            # features/steps/todo_steps.py:67

  Scenario Outline: Filter todos -- @1.3   # features/todo.feature:58
    Given I am on the todo page            # features/steps/todo_steps.py:6
    Given I have the following todos:      # features/steps/todo_steps.py:17
      | text   | completed |
      | Task 1 | false     |
      | Task 2 | true      |
      | Task 3 | false     |
    When I filter by "Completed"           # features/steps/todo_steps.py:62
    Then I should see 1 todo(s)            # features/steps/todo_steps.py:67

